        <mxCell id="P3_1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3.1&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:2px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Request Query Parser &amp;amp; Modul Dispatcher&lt;/div&gt; &lt;hr style=&quot;border:1px solid #007ACC;margin:5px 0;&quot;&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;text-align:left;line-height:1.4;color:#000000;&quot;&gt; • Parse pilihan modul: Data Mikro / Statistik Wilayah&lt;br&gt; • Parse filter: NIK, KK, Desil, Rentang Usia/Gaji&lt;br&gt; • Sanitasi parameter cegah SQL Injection &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#66B2FF;strokeColor=#007ACC;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="240" width="280" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="P3_2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3.2&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:2px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Memory-Mapped Vector Slicing Engine&lt;/div&gt; &lt;hr style=&quot;border:1px solid #007ACC;margin:5px 0;&quot;&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;text-align:left;line-height:1.4;color:#000000;&quot;&gt; • Eksekusi query teroptimasi DuckDB zero-copy&lt;br&gt; • Kecepatan respons &amp;lt; 0.05 detik pada 13M+ baris&lt;br&gt; • Pisahkan aliran: Record Individual vs Aggregation &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#66B2FF;strokeColor=#007ACC;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="750" y="240" width="300" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="P3_3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3.3&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:2px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Dynamic PII Masking Transformer&lt;/div&gt; &lt;hr style=&quot;border:1px solid #007ACC;margin:5px 0;&quot;&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;text-align:left;line-height:1.4;color:#000000;&quot;&gt; • NIK: 3201************ (4 digit awal)&lt;br&gt; • Nama: B*** S****** (huruf pertama tiap kata)&lt;br&gt; • Gaji: Rp 8.xxx.xxx | Alamat: sensor parsial &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#66B2FF;strokeColor=#007ACC;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1160" y="240" width="280" height="120" as="geometry" />
