        <mxCell id="P3_4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3.4&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:2px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Transliterasi FK &amp;amp; Metadata Label Mapper&lt;/div&gt; &lt;hr style=&quot;border:1px solid #007ACC;margin:5px 0;&quot;&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;text-align:left;line-height:1.4;color:#000000;&quot;&gt; • Ubah kode numerik menjadi label deskriptif:&lt;br&gt;   - Air Minum: &#39;1&#39; &amp;rarr; &#39;Kemasan Bermerk&#39;, &#39;2&#39; &amp;rarr; &#39;Sumur&#39;&lt;br&gt;   - Lantai: &#39;01&#39; &amp;rarr; &#39;Marmer&#39;, &#39;02&#39; &amp;rarr; &#39;Keramik&#39;&lt;br&gt;   - Gender: &#39;1&#39; &amp;rarr; &#39;Laki-Laki&#39;, &#39;2&#39; &amp;rarr; &#39;Perempuan&#39;&lt;br&gt; • Hasilkan Master Record Mikro Terpadu &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#66B2FF;strokeColor=#007ACC;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1540" y="240" width="310" height="135" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="P3_5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3.5&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:2px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Dynamic Regional Aggregator (7 Metrik)&lt;/div&gt; &lt;hr style=&quot;border:1px solid #007ACC;margin:5px 0;&quot;&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;text-align:left;line-height:1.4;color:#000000;&quot;&gt; • Agregasi multi-level: Kab/Kota &amp;rarr; Kec &amp;rarr; Desa/Kel&lt;br&gt; • 7 Rumus Metrik Statistik Terpilih:&lt;br&gt;   - COUNT (Jiwa/KK), SUM (Finansial), AVG (Rata-rata)&lt;br&gt;   - MIN, MAX, MEDIAN, MODUS Distribusi&lt;br&gt; • Hasilkan Rangkuman Tabel Statistik Wilayah &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#66B2FF;strokeColor=#007ACC;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1160" y="480" width="320" height="135" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="P3_6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3.6&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:2px;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Dual-Module View &amp;amp; Navigation Generator&lt;/div&gt; &lt;hr style=&quot;border:1px solid #007ACC;margin:5px 0;&quot;&gt; &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;text-align:left;line-height:1.4;color:#000000;&quot;&gt; • Render Tab 1: Grid Data Mikro Terpadu (Transliterasi FK)&lt;br&gt; • Render Tab 2: Tabel Agregasi Statistik Wilayah Dinamis&lt;br&gt; • Transmisi tampilan aman ke browser Operator &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#66B2FF;strokeColor=#007ACC;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
